  "html": "<p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXxJrut52yPT4JpsR4zDOZZPGiCQqZWZG-hDuNM9Nh0x2GcXuTZ_4Ir9Iz270q3QMGaR6WdbLpUbd6kdW-8B-q8GUKF45Hw3oJ9JpvybCdsIpz-IHUgUNQ9IFkLFQeWSw9Qg_zap1E3ecekkRhqBA_4gB8vvxRTVzaz-mvmE9KxrMrgi3Q3_3n69RfmYI/s1536/Copilot_20250617_095926.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1536\" height=\"266\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXxJrut52yPT4JpsR4zDOZZPGiCQqZWZG-hDuNM9Nh0x2GcXuTZ_4Ir9Iz270q3QMGaR6WdbLpUbd6kdW-8B-q8GUKF45Hw3oJ9JpvybCdsIpz-IHUgUNQ9IFkLFQeWSw9Qg_zap1E3ecekkRhqBA_4gB8vvxRTVzaz-mvmE9KxrMrgi3Q3_3n69RfmYI/w400-h266/Copilot_20250617_095926.png\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p data-end=\"141\" data-start=\"104\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Artificial Intelligence has swiftly become a <strong data-end=\"58\" data-start=\"45\">hot topic</strong> in ministry circles. On one side, many see AI as a powerful tool for sermon prep; on the other, critics argue it's tantamount to spiritual compromise. My perspective? AI can (and should) be a tool—but never a substitute for spiritual dependence.</span></p>\n<hr data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"143\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"195\" data-start=\"148\">✅ Why Some Embrace AI in Sermon Preparation</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"434\" data-start=\"197\"><li data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"197\">\n<p data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"199\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"25\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Research acceleration</strong>: AI can quickly aggregate commentary, Greek/Hebrew lexicon insights, sermon outlines, and sermon illustrations—similar to having a digital research assistant.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">blog.tms.edu</span></span></span></a></span></span><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://exponential.org/pros-and-cons-of-using-ai-for-sermon-writing-18-issues-to-consider/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://exponential.org/pros-and-cons-of-using-ai-for-sermon-writing-18-issues-to-consider/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">exponential.org</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">backstorypreaching.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"277\">\n<p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"279\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"24\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Editorial competence</strong>: It helps refine logic, enhance clarity, polish grammar, and improve readability without changing the core message.</span> </p>\n</li><li data-end=\"434\" data-start=\"357\">\n<p data-end=\"434\" data-start=\"359\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"25\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Church communications</strong>: Beyond sermons, AI assists pastors with writing newsletters, emails, social media posts—maintaining personal voice while improving clarity.</span> </p>\n</li></ul>\n<p data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"436\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A Barna survey supports this: <strong data-end=\"48\" data-start=\"30\">43% of pastors</strong> see AI's merits in sermon prep and research—but only <strong data-end=\"109\" data-start=\"102\">12%</strong> would let it write full sermons.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.barna.com/research/pastors-use-ai/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.barna.com/research/pastors-use-ai/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">barna.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">apnews.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<hr data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"513\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"561\" data-start=\"518\">⚠️ Why Others Warn Against Over reliance</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"563\"><li data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"563\">\n<p data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"565\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"28\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Spiritual formation lost</strong>: Critics argue that sermon prep is an act of worship. The slow discipline of prayerful meditation cultivates growth that AI cannot replicate.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.mbts.edu/article/midwestern-seminary-panel-on-technology-and-ecclesiology-considers-use-of-ai-online-church-services/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.mbts.edu/article/midwestern-seminary-panel-on-technology-and-ecclesiology-considers-use-of-ai-online-church-services/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">mbts.edu</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"730\" data-start=\"647\">\n<p data-end=\"730\" data-start=\"649\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"24\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Loss of authenticity</strong>: AI lacks emotional resonance, personal journey, and pastoral insight—elements that make sermons impactful.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://apnews.com/article/65822bf1c46de7630d3441e9ff4ff41a?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/65822bf1c46de7630d3441e9ff4ff41a?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">chron.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+7</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">apnews.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+7</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">desiringgod.org</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+7</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"731\">\n<p data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"733\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"33\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Ethical pitfalls &amp; dependency</strong>: There's risk of plagiarism or outsourcing spiritual labor to a machine. And dependency on AI efficiency may distract from worshipful, contemplative study.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">barna.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+11</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">blog.tms.edu</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+11</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">puritanboard.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+11</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li></ul>\n<hr data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"814\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"819\">🛠️ My Position: Use AI, But Use It Wisely</h3>\n<ol data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"867\"><li data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"867\">\n<p data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"870\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"35\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Don’t ask AI for entire sermons</strong>. Rather than \"Give me a sermon to preach this week,\" select your Scripture prayerfully and then use AI to:</span></p>\n<ul data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"913\"><li data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"913\">\n<p data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"915\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Find illustrations and anecdotes</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"958\">\n<p data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"960\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Access Greek/Hebrew meaning and contextual exegesis</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"1003\">\n<p data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"1005\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Generate sermon title ideas and thematic outlines</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.backstorypreaching.com/blog/should-preachers-use-ai-for-sermons-artificial-intelligence-primer-and-discussion-of-moral-maze?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.backstorypreaching.com/blog/should-preachers-use-ai-for-sermons-artificial-intelligence-primer-and-discussion-of-moral-maze?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">apnews.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+2</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">backstorypreaching.com</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+2</span></span><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">desiringgod.org</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+2</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"1088\">\n<p data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"1090\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Edit drafts for clarity and correctness</span></p>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1131\">\n<p data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1134\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"34\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Maintain your spiritual rhythm</strong>: Study Scripture prayerfully. Let the Word form you—not just inform you.</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1217\" data-start=\"1175\">\n<p data-end=\"1217\" data-start=\"1178\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"21\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Retain authorship</strong>: Your thoughts, insights, and voice must remain primary. AI’s role is to augment—not replace—you.</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"1219\">\n<p data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"1222\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"26\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Apply spiritual checks</strong>: Always evaluate AI-sourced content in light of Scripture and led by the Holy Spirit.</span></p>\n</li></ol>\n<hr data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1263\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1297\" data-start=\"1268\">🎥 Voices from Both Sides</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1571\" data-start=\"1299\"><strong data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1299\">Critical view</strong><br data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1316\" />\n<a class=\"cursor-pointer\" data-end=\"1531\" data-start=\"1319\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">Don’t Be an Artificial Preacher (Argument Against AI) – John Dube and others highlight the dangers of outsourcing spiritual work cite</a><br />\n<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://blog.tms.edu/dont-be-an-artificial-preacher\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">blog.tms.edu</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1634\" data-start=\"1573\"><strong data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1573\">Supportive view</strong><br data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1592\" />\n<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?pp=0gcJCdgAo7VqN5tD&amp;v=PqzOpOxkpxw\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?pp=0gcJCdgAo7VqN5tD&amp;v=PqzOpOxkpxw\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">youtube.com</span></span></span></a></span></span><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.desiringgod.org/messages/authentic-preaching-in-the-age-of-ai\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.desiringgod.org/messages/authentic-preaching-in-the-age-of-ai\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">desiringgod.org</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1636\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1641\">✍️ Practical Examples</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1793\" data-start=\"1668\"><li data-end=\"1709\" data-start=\"1668\">\n<p data-end=\"1709\" data-start=\"1670\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"27\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Research &amp; illustration</strong>: Use AI to discover stories, historical context, or linguistic nuance that enriches the text of Scripture.</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1751\" data-start=\"1710\">\n<p data-end=\"1751\" data-start=\"1712\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"19\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Writing clarity</strong>: I often draft emails or messages, then ask AI to clean up grammar and enhance readability—without changing my core message.</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1793\" data-start=\"1752\">\n<p data-end=\"1793\" data-start=\"1754\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"18\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Editorial tool</strong>: Paste your sermon draft into AI for feedback on flow, tone, or coherence—it flags gaps you might miss.</span></p>\n</li></ul>\n<hr data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1795\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1815\" data-start=\"1800\">🚦 Takeaway</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1856\" data-start=\"1817\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">AI is not sinful—it's <strong data-end=\"44\" data-start=\"22\">neutral technology</strong>. Like commentaries and study Bibles, it’s a tool. Whether it’s time-saving or time-wasting depends on <em data-end=\"152\" data-start=\"147\">how</em> and <em data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"157\">why</em> you use it.</span></p>\n<ul data-end=\"1941\" data-start=\"1858\"><li data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1858\">\n<p data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1860\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"12\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Good use</strong>: Tools that free time for prayer, study, and personal growth.</span></p>\n</li><li data-end=\"1941\" data-start=\"1900\">\n<p data-end=\"1941\" data-start=\"1902\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-end=\"11\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Bad use</strong>: Letting AI write your sermons, surrendering spiritual formation, or hiding behind machine-generated text.</span></p>\n</li></ul>\n<p data-end=\"1982\" data-start=\"1943\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A preacher must be connected to God, drawing inspiration from the Holy Spirit. AI can <em data-end=\"94\" data-start=\"86\">assist</em>, but it’s the preacher’s responsibility to shepherd, reflect, and embody the message.</span></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1987\" data-start=\"1984\" />\n<h2 data-end=\"2008\" data-start=\"1989\">🎯 Final Thought</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2049\" data-start=\"2010\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">In today's digital era, we’re called to be <strong data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"43\">wise stewards</strong> of technology—embracing tools that support ministry without compromising spiritual authenticity. Used rightly, AI can be a blessing. Used poorly, it can become a crutch—or worse, a false idol.</span></p>\n<hr data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"2051\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"2078\" data-start=\"2056\">📚 Further Reading</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2247\" data-start=\"2080\"><li data-end=\"2163\" data-start=\"2080\">\n<p data-end=\"2163\" data-start=\"2082\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><em data-end=\"46\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"0\">Pros and Cons of Using AI for Sermon Writing</em> – a deep-dive into both sides of the argument</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a alt=\"https://www.backstorypreaching.com/blog/should-preachers-use-ai-for-sermons-artificial-intelligence-primer-and-discussion-of-moral-maze?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secon